{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>Only Fans女星Piper Rockelle社交媒體上發佈視頻，她淚流滿面地表示計劃起訴R星，因為他們在遊戲中將她描繪成街頭妓女。她説：「我絕不會容忍這種事，我被以錯誤的方式性化了。」也有玩家稱，她其實就是為了蹭熱度……</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960172_981097.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960171_293797_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960172_766131_jpg_r.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960171_657470.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960172_488802.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960173_232289.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960173_738795.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960173_461038.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960173_768981.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960173_303162.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960173_130053.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960173_632805.jpg\">\n</p>\n\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https://img.3dmgame.com/uploads/images/news/20260829/1787960172_981097.jpg\">\n</p>\n<p>\n<img alt=\"Only Fans女星想起訴R星 將其描繪成街頭妓女\" src=\"https